## h i g h l i g h t s
The photocatalyst with ternary hollow core-shell structure, which can effectively separate electrons from holes and store electrons in an electron library, was synthesized by template method and self-assembly method.   
The storage capacity of electronic library with adjustable microelectronic structure is affected by surface polarization, which could support the requirement call from the CoP QDs as active-sites   
The smooth electron transfer channels from electron libraries to quantum dots as active sites can improve the separation and efficient utilization of photoexcited electrons.
